{"page":269,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"262","words":[{"text":"262","x":188,"y":139,"width":73,"height":35}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":570,"y":144,"width":124,"height":25},{"text":"03","x":706,"y":145,"width":32,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":772,"y":151,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":817,"y":146,"width":133,"height":28},{"text":"계층","x":961,"y":143,"width":52,"height":31}]},{"text":"랜스포트 계층 프로토콜이라기 보단 혼잡제어 프로토콜이다. DCCP처럼 또 다른 트랜","words":[{"text":"랜스포트","x":547,"y":272,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"계층","x":695,"y":273,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜이라기","x":773,"y":272,"width":235,"height":38},{"text":"보단","x":1025,"y":271,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"혼잡제어","x":1106,"y":269,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜이다.","x":1256,"y":269,"width":213,"height":38},{"text":"DCCP처럼","x":1485,"y":270,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"또","x":1673,"y":274,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"다른","x":1722,"y":270,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"트랜","x":1801,"y":276,"width":60,"height":39}]},{"text":"2`xt드 프로토콜에서 이용될 수 있는 혼잡제어 메커니즘을 명시한다-(실제로, DCCP에","words":[{"text":"2`xt드","x":548,"y":333,"width":93,"height":24},{"text":"프로토콜에서","x":659,"y":332,"width":198,"height":38},{"text":"이용될","x":875,"y":332,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":989,"y":332,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1038,"y":330,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡제어","x":1117,"y":329,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"메커니즘을","x":1268,"y":329,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"명시한다-(실제로,","x":1454,"y":330,"width":265,"height":40},{"text":"DCCP에","x":1734,"y":335,"width":125,"height":41}]},{"text":"서 기용한 2개의 애플리게이션 선택적인 기능한 프로토콜 중 하나는 TFRC이다).","words":[{"text":"서","x":545,"y":392,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"기용한","x":596,"y":393,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"2개의","x":717,"y":392,"width":84,"height":38},{"text":"애플리게이션","x":824,"y":392,"width":207,"height":38},{"text":"선택적인","x":1053,"y":390,"width":136,"heig