t":"일어나는","x":1680,"y":1122,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"모","x":1829,"y":1128,"width":30,"height":29}]},{"text":"든 것을 다루고 있다. 이것으로 애플리케이션 계층과 트랜스포트 계층을 다룸으로써","words":[{"text":"든","x":532,"y":1185,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"것을","x":585,"y":1184,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"다루고","x":668,"y":1184,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":787,"y":1183,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"이것으로","x":879,"y":1182,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":1031,"y":1183,"width":202,"height":37},{"text":"계층과","x":1253,"y":1183,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1372,"y":1183,"width":178,"height":36},{"text":"계층을","x":1569,"y":1183,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"다룸으로써","x":1693,"y":1183,"width":163,"height":41}]},{"text":"네트워크 가장자리의 설명을 마친다. 이제는 네트워크 코어를 조사할 때이다. 이 여행","words":[{"text":"네트워크","x":533,"y":1244,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"가장자리의","x":681,"y":1243,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"설명을","x":864,"y":1243,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"마친다.","x":979,"y":1243,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"이제는","x":1106,"y":1244,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":1222,"y":1243,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"코어를","x":1373,"y":1244,"width":106,"height":36},{"text":"조사할","x":1494,"y":1244,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"때이다.","x":1618,"y":1242,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1751,"y":1243,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"여행","x":1799,"y":1244,"width":58,"height":40}]},{"text":"은 다음 두 장에서 시작한다. 그곳에서 네트워크 계층을 설명할 것이고, 그리고 링크","words":[{"text":"은","x":528,"y":1305,"width":35,"height":34},{"text":"다음","x":579,"y":1304,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":661,"y":1306,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"장에서","x":711,"y":1304,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"시작한다.","x":829,"y":1304,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"그곳에서","x":989,"y":1304,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1143,"y":1304,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"계층을","x":1296,"y":1304,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"설명할","x":1417,"y":1304,"width":106,"height":37