"width":61,"height":37}]},{"text":"먼트와 목적지 호스트 주소를 받는다. 그러고 나서 네트워크 계층은 목적지 호스","words":[{"text":"먼트와","x":613,"y":1859,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"목적지","x":725,"y":1859,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":840,"y":1860,"width":99,"height":31},{"text":"주소를","x":952,"y":1859,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"받는다.","x":1068,"y":1857,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"그러고","x":1190,"y":1856,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"나서","x":1308,"y":1857,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1392,"y":1857,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"계층은","x":1552,"y":1859,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"목적지","x":1675,"y":1859,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"호스","x":1798,"y":1862,"width":61,"height":30}]},{"text":"트의 트랜스포트 계층에게 세그먼트를 전달하는 것을 보장한다. 다수의 네트워","words":[{"text":"트의","x":612,"y":1921,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":696,"y":1920,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"계층에게","x":880,"y":1919,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":1030,"y":1919,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"전달하는","x":1216,"y":1918,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":1373,"y":1919,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"보장한다.","x":1459,"y":1920,"width":154,"height":38},{"text":"다수의","x":1634,"y":1921,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"네트워","x":1763,"y":1920,"width":94,"height":39}]},{"text":"그 애플리케이션 프로세스들이 목적지 호스트에서 실행될 수 있다고 가정하자.","words":[{"text":"그","x":612,"y":1987,"width":33,"height":27},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":658,"y":1981,"width":199,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스들이","x":872,"y":1981,"width":197,"height":39},{"text":"목적지","x":1085,"y":1981,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"호스트에서","x":1200,"y":1981,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"실행될","x":1387,"y":1981,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1506,"y":1982,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"있다고","x":1559,"y":1982,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"가정하자.","x":1684,"y":1982,"width":147,"height":39}]},{"text":"a. 목적지 호스트에 있는 프로세스에서 애플리게이션 데이터를 가질 수 있는 가","words":[{"text":"a.","x":612,"y":2069,"width":24,"height":20},{"text":"목적지","x":666